# PR 17: strategy refactor

Reviewer note:

> The strategy hook should not remain caller-selectable during rotation. Pin it to vault config before
> forwarding vault signer privilege. The old path made review too dependent on caller discipline.

```diff
 pub fn execute_strategy(ctx: Context<ExecuteStrategy>, amount: u64) -> Result<()> {
     let vault = &ctx.accounts.vault;
+    require_keys_eq!(
+        ctx.accounts.strategy_program.key(),
+        vault.pinned_strategy_program,
+        ErrorCode::InvalidStrategyProgram
+    );
     // CPI uses invoke_signed with the vault-authority PDA. The strategy ABI
     // receives that PDA as a signer so it can rebalance the reserve.
     invoke_strategy(ctx, amount)
```
